            <profile name="Black Rage" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">You can re-roll a Hit roll of 1 with melee weapons.
While the unit is not within 6" of a friendly BLOOD ANGELS CHARACTER unit, while the unit is not within 12" of a friendly CHAPLAIN unit, the unit cannot Fall Back.
While the unit is not within 6" of a friendly BLOOD ANGELS CHARACTER unit, while the unit is not within 12" of a friendly CHAPLAIN unit, set the unit's Objective Control characteristic to 0.</characteristic>
